+[What has been tested, and where](#what-has-been-tested-and-where): x86-64, Ubuntu 24.04, **no
+USB and no KVM**, so the virtual machine's processor was emulated in software. The virtual
+machine: QEMU 8.2.2, the OVMF firmware with Secure Boot on and Microsoft's keys, 2 GB of memory,
+a SATA disk, an Intel network card. The last whole run of `firmware/test/image.sh`, on the
